<section class="architecture" aria-labelledby="architecture-title">
  <div class="diagram-heading"><div><h2 id="architecture-title">From question to answer</h2></div></div>
  <p class="diagram-intro">The primary path uses the knowledge base. The dashed Exa branch searches official FSU domains when that content is insufficient.</p>
  <div class="diagram-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Chloe architecture diagram, scroll horizontally to explore"><svg id="flow" viewBox="0 0 1330 540" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-title flow-desc" class="flow-diagram" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif">
          <title id="flow-title">Chloe question to answer loop</title>
          <desc id="flow-desc">A visitor's question goes through the chat UI to a streaming FastAPI Lambda, which checks Turnstile and runs an agent. The agent embeds the query with Titan, searches Weaviate, Exa only as a fallback when the knowledge base has no info, and Bedrock, then the answer streams back to the chat UI and the visitor.</desc>
